{"2540620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro", "steam_appid": 2540620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro</strong> is a multiplayer first person shooter in <strong>zero gravity</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/8fc5bcb703289384f1cb106f57f5998a.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together dashes, mag-slides, kicks, and more to reach top speeds! If you’re looking for a new movement shooter to master, look no further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/b3ca8da44c8bb19c6e4240f28707a008.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of eleven items, from classic fps guns to boomerangs, nets, and swords!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/f8816c2be9c49f7829aa6c3329d0c09c.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab other players, kick floating cubes, deflect bullets into enemies, or whatever else you can dream up using Astro’s fully sandbox networked physics. The only constraint is your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/0cd28a12fbf54bb1d3331bba9afd42d1.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic fps game modes like domination or free-for-all, reimagined in a zero gravity environment. And if you’re craving something new, then it’s time to try Battle, Soccer, King, or any of Astro’s other original game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/e2465cac10fa84a501e3ce1f61c4b6d5.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no description can ever do Astro justice, you need to experience the thrills of zero gravity combat yourself. <u>Ready to redefine your idea of what a first person shooter can be?</u> Dive into Astro!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro</strong> is a multiplayer first person shooter in <strong>zero gravity</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/8fc5bcb703289384f1cb106f57f5998a.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together dashes, mag-slides, kicks, and more to reach top speeds! If you’re looking for a new movement shooter to master, look no further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/70a00da9e24c1c38250376aad41c0de7.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/b3ca8da44c8bb19c6e4240f28707a008.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of eleven items, from classic fps guns to boomerangs, nets, and swords!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/22792fdc33dd6067ff79bed63e7d9d8b.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/f8816c2be9c49f7829aa6c3329d0c09c.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab other players, kick floating cubes, deflect bullets into enemies, or whatever else you can dream up using Astro’s fully sandbox networked physics. The only constraint is your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/bb97568fd6ae4055fc642e1f4917fff3.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/0cd28a12fbf54bb1d3331bba9afd42d1.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic fps game modes like domination or free-for-all, reimagined in a zero gravity environment. And if you’re craving something new, then it’s time to try Battle, Soccer, King, or any of Astro’s other original game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.poster.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.webm?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/4c362abbb28eef994fc5831a5b42bae5.mp4?t=1787190417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/extras/e2465cac10fa84a501e3ce1f61c4b6d5.avif?t=1787190417\" width=608 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no description can ever do Astro justice, you need to experience the thrills of zero gravity combat yourself. <u>Ready to redefine your idea of what a first person shooter can be?</u> Dive into Astro!</p>", "short_description": "Astro is a multiplayer fps, which explores the mind-bending opportunities of movement and gun fights in zero gravity. It focuses on the fun over realism, with deep and unique mechanics, weapons, and abilities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/d0eee5cd64fdef1388d1cc21370412062f3beed5/header.jpg?t=1787190417", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/75783d1174377b65d0171235b8b12d75c4655258/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787190417", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540620/75783d1174377b65d0171235b8b12d75c4655258/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787190417", "website": "https://delgoodie.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit / Windows 11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit / Windows 11 64-B